    "lines": [
      {
        "scene": "hook",
        "text": "How did melted chocolate give Raytheon the microwave?",
        "start": 0.3,
        "seconds": 3.79,
        "window": 4.17,
        "fill": 0.909
      },
      {
        "scene": "lab",
        "text": "In 1945, radar engineer Percy Spencer felt the chocolate in his pocket go soft.",
        "start": 4.47,
        "seconds": 6.77,
        "window": 7.37,
        "fill": 0.919
      },
      {
        "scene": "tube",
        "text": "Nothing near him was hot, so what melted it? A magnetron: the tube that makes microwaves.",
        "start": 11.83,
        "seconds": 6.6,
        "window": 7.13,
        "fill": 0.926
      },
      {
        "scene": "inside",
        "text": "Inside, a magnet bends electrons into a spinning wheel past little copper cavities.",
        "start": 18.97,
        "seconds": 6.2,
        "window": 6.7,
        "fill": 0.925
      },
      {
        "scene": "ring",
        "text": "Each cavity rings like a whistle, and invisible waves pour out.",
        "start": 25.67,
        "seconds": 4.58,
        "window": 5.0,
        "fill": 0.916
      },
      {
        "scene": "water",
        "text": "They shake the water in food, and that shaking is heat. He tried popcorn: it popped.",
        "start": 30.67,
        "seconds": 5.89,
        "window": 6.33,
        "fill": 0.93
      },
      {
        "scene": "box",
        "text": "But to cook dinner, the waves had to stay inside. So Raytheon shut the tube in a metal box: the Radarange.",
        "start": 37.0,
        "seconds": 7.76,
        "window": 8.23,
        "fill": 0.943
      },
      {
        "scene": "payoff",
        "text": "The first one stood almost as tall as a man, weighed 750 pounds and cost about $5,000.",
        "start": 45.23,
        "seconds": 8.14,
        "window": 8.77,
        "fill": 0.928
      },
      {
        "scene": "loop",
        "text": "Today that same tube hums in your kitchen, all thanks to one melted candy bar.",
        "start": 54.0,
        "seconds": 5.43,
        "window": 6.07,
        "fill": 0.895
      }
    ]
  },
